<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS2.SSS0.Px2" title="In B.2 Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix B Appendix for Section ‣ Learning to Play Multi-Follower Bayesian Stackelberg Games" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Analysis of <math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{O}(\sqrt{LT\log(nKAT})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒪</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>A</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow><mo fence="true" lspace="0em">CLOSE</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{O}(\sqrt{LT\log(nKAT})</annotation></semantics></math> Regret:</span></a></li>
