</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS3" title="In Appendix B Appendix for Section ‣ Learning to Play Multi-Follower Bayesian Stackelberg Games" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.3 </span>Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS4" title="In Appendix B Appendix for Section ‣ Learning to Play Multi-Follower Bayesian Stackelberg Games" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.4 </span><math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Omega(\sqrt{\min\{L,K\}T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Omega(\sqrt{\min\{L,K\}T})</annotation></semantics></math> Lower Bound in the Single-Follower Case</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS5" title="In Appendix B Appendix for Section ‣ Learning to Play Multi-Follower Bayesian Stackelberg Games" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.5 </span><math class="ltx_Math" alttext="\Omega(\sqrt{\min\{L,nK\}T})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">Ω</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msqrt><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>,</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>T</mi></mrow></mrow></msqrt><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\Omega(\sqrt{\min\{L,nK\}T})</annotation></semantics></math> Lower Bound for the Multi-Follower Case: Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_subsection">
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#A2.SS5.SSS0.Px1" title="In B.5 Ω(√min{{𝐿,𝑛⁢𝐾}⁢𝑇}) Lower Bound for the Multi-Follower Case: Proof of Theorem ‣ Appendix B Appendix for Section ‣ Learning to Play Multi-Follower Bayesian Stackelberg Games" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Single-Follower Bayesian Stackelberg Game instance:</span></a></li>
